WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Everyone says that your Houhai Village Pier is under the protection of the Dragon King.

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,000
This is how we often achieve great results

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,400
To feel happy

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,680
We specially drove the boat to the pier of your village

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:12,000
Is it right to start working from here again?

6
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,130
I heard that it was the same person who caught the black eagle and the deep sea.

7
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:16,770
Tell me about such good luck

8
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:19,810
You want me to tell you why we were bumped into by the same person?

9
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,450
He must have stepped in dog poop.

10
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:25,120
It's not you who got lucky.

11
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,800
How do you know it's not right?

12
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:32,950
Why did you come to the dock at this point? I'm going fishing too. Are you kidding me about fishing?

13
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:36,360
How could you, Zhang Jianguo, do such a thing? If you don’t believe me, I’ll knock you down.

14
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,320
I have to hurry up and go to sea first.

15
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,320
Although I have a good relationship with Ma San

16
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,240
But it's not time to tell him yet

17
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:45,910
The lucky one is that once I say it,

18
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:47,830
He will inevitably want to go to sea with me

19
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:51,210
If you don't agree by then, you'll get into trouble. If you agree,

20
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,010
Just one more competitor

21
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,330
After all, my family has not yet had a father who has lifted himself out of poverty.
